# nexora-action-code: get_mac_table
Value Required MAC_ADDRESS ([0-9A-Fa-f]{4}(?:-[0-9A-Fa-f]{4}){2})
Value Required VLAN (\d+|-)
Value PEVLAN (\S+)
Value CEVLAN (\S+)
Value Required PORT ((?:[0-9]+)?[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9-]*\s*\d[\w/.-]*)
Value Required TYPE ([Dd]ynamic|[Ss]tatic|[Bb]lackhole|[Ss]ecure|[Aa]uthen)
Value LSP_LSR_ID (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${VLAN}\s+${PEVLAN}\s+${CEVLAN}\s+${PORT}\s+${TYPE}(?:\s+${LSP_LSR_ID})?\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${VLAN}\s+${PORT}\s+${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*MAC\s+Address\s+VLAN/VSI(?:/BD)?\s+.*$$
  ^\s*MAC\s+Address\s+VLAN\s+.*$$
  ^\s*(?:Flags:|BD\s*:|Total\s+.*|Total\s*:).*$$
  ^\s*[-=]+\s*$$
  ^\s*<[^>]+>.*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error
